{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262d2HRUsbKS1793709883.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>上周病逝的國務院前副總理劉延東，遺體今日在北京火化。</p><p></p><p>儀式上午在北京八寶山革命公墓禮堂舉行，劉延東的遺體蓋上中國共產黨黨旗。</p><p></p><p><strong>領導人到場送別慰問親屬</strong></p><p></p><p>中共總書記習近平等領導人到場送別，向劉延東的遺體三鞠躬，及向她的親屬握手表示慰問。前國家主席胡錦濤送上花圈致意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LIU-2000-1_CLEAN_20261103_200942_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269w1GrbEkUk1793709922.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>新華社報道病重及逝世後慰問</strong></p><p></p><p>劉延東上周三在北京病逝，終年81歲。新華社道指，在劉延東病重期間及逝世後，習近平、李強等領導人及胡錦濤等人前往醫院探望，或以各種形式向其逝世，表示沉痛哀悼，並向其親屬表示深切慰問。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LIU-2000-1_CLEAN_20261103_200942_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026silB3BSmd91793709936.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.966018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:18.619551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:39.078837+00:00","content_hash":"37b4d2a1539261b32655011751ea5259421c2c09af099575298f5cc1c51a5871","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.966018+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}